---

### Recommended `.gitignore`

When initializing the repository on GitHub, select the default **Java** `.gitignore` template, or ensure your local `.gitignore` includes:

```gitignore
# Compiled class files
*.class

# Log files
*.log

# Package Files
*.jar
*.war
*.nar
*.ear
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# Maven / Gradle build outputs
target/
build/
.gradle/

# IDE specific files
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.settings/
.project
.classpath